# Build artifacts
/target/

# Runtime logs
*.log

# Protocol capture data (large, local-only RE fixtures)
/flows
*.pcapng
/working_docs

# webrtc.1 captures (RDPIO_WEBRTC_CAPTURE). Raw captures contain the capturing
# machine's public/LAN addresses, device identifiers and stale send-buffer heap
# bytes — never commit one without sanitizing it first. The one checked-in
# fixture below has been sanitized.
*.wrtc
!crates/rdp-webrtc/tests/fixtures/teams_call.wrtc

# Connection files and credential/token caches. `.rdp` files carry hostnames,
# usernames, tenant and Cloud PC identifiers; the caches carry live tokens.
# Match cache *data* only: a bare `password_cache*` also swallowed
# crates/rdp-client/src/password_cache.rs, which broke the Windows build (the
# module is `#[cfg(windows)]`, so Linux never noticed it was missing).
*.rdp
token_cache*.json
password_cache*.json
password_cache*.bin
w365_password.bin
